cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BChemXtractWeb in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "BChemXtractWeb: A web application for extracting chemical structures and reactions from ChemDraw files"
abstract: >-
  BChemXtractWeb is a browser-based interface and REST API for the pure-Java
  BChemXtract library. It lets chemists upload ChemDraw CDX/CDXML files and
  extract structures and reactions — enriched with InChI, InChIKey, SMILES,
  RInChI, and molecular formulas — without installing Java or a command line.
